          "id": "62a5918e-9dec-4529-861b-a8e08c525cba",
          "name": "Combined roster for the broker team page.",
          "request": {
            "name": "Combined roster for the broker team page.",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the agency's team members merged with email-integration mailbox\nusers in a single list, deduplicated by email address:\n- Every team member appears once with ``source: \"team\"``. When a mailbox\n  user with the same email exists, it is attached as ``email_user``.\n- Mailbox users with no matching team member appear as ``source: \"email\"``\n  rows (admin and maintainer requesters only), with the team-member fields\n  set to null and the mailbox data in ``email_user``.\n\nResponse shape: ``{\"count\": <int>, \"results\": [<row>, ...]}`` with no\npagination — the team page filters and paginates client-side.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
